<!-- ===================== 01 THE PARTNERSHIP ===================== -->
<section class="pt-sec" id="partnership">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rev">
      <p class="kick">About the partnership</p>
      <h2>Where Microsoft's platform meets <em>ITHENA's expertise</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">Microsoft gives enterprises a powerful foundation for cloud, productivity, security and AI. ITHENA helps you turn that foundation into results.</p>
      <p class="body">Together, we help organizations connect data, processes and teams to drive revenue: intelligent CRM and ERP applications, secure cloud environments, modern productivity tools and AI-ready data platforms. Our joint approach supports your remote and hybrid workforce, streamlines operations and helps you build a resilient, purpose-driven organization.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillars stg">
      <article class="pillar">
        <i>01 &middot; Commercial</i>
        <h3>Licensing expertise</h3>
        <p>So you pay the right price for the right products, on the right agreement, with renewals planned instead of inherited.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="pillar">
        <i>02 &middot; Technical</i>
        <h3>Technical depth</h3>
        <p>Across cloud migration, security, data and application development, delivered by engineers who have run these environments themselves.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="pillar">
        <i>03 &middot; Sector</i>
        <h3>Industry context</h3>
        <p>From years of digital delivery across manufacturing, life sciences, automotive, energy and utilities, government and media.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===================== 02 OFFERINGS (platform pattern) ===================== -->
<section class="pt-sec deep" id="platform">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rev">
      <p class="kick">Our Microsoft offerings</p>
      <h2>Everything you need to <em>get more from Microsoft</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">One relationship that carries your Microsoft estate from the licence you buy all the way to the AI your teams actually use.</p>
      <ol class="flow" aria-label="Microsoft estate lifecycle">
        <li>Licence</li><li>Migrate</li><li>Secure</li><li>Work</li><li>Build</li><li>Enable</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <ol class="cards rev">
      <li class="card"><span class="cnum" aria-hidden="true">01</span><span class="badge"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-tag"/></svg></span><div class="pop-body"><h3>Microsoft Licensing &amp; Renewals</h3><p>Buy your Microsoft subscriptions through ITHENA and save up to 15% on the exact same products. We handle purchasing, billing options and renewal planning so nothing lapses and nothing is overpaid.</p><span class="tagx">Lead offer</span></div></li>
      <li class="card"><span class="cnum" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span class="badge"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-cloud"/></svg></span><div class="pop-body"><h3>Cloud Adoption &amp; Migration</h3><p>Our experts deliver smooth migrations and cloud-native applications in a trusted, secure environment. You can also reduce costs by using your existing eligible Windows licenses.</p></div></li>
      <li class="card"><span class="cnum" aria-hidden="true">03</span><span class="badge"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-shield"/></svg></span><div class="pop-body"><h3>Security &amp; Compliance</h3><p>Protect your network activity and your people with Microsoft Defender, Entra ID and Intune, backed by built-in compliance tools and guidance from our team.</p></div></li>
      <li class="card"><span class="cnum" aria-hidden="true">04</span><span class="badge"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-screen"/></svg></span><div class="pop-body"><h3>Modern Workplace &amp; Productivity</h3><p>Give hybrid and remote teams secure, cloud-based tools for voice, collaboration, security and analytics. Set up once and supported continuously.</p></div></li>
      <li class="card"><span class="cnum" aria-hidden="true">05</span><span class="badge"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-net"/></svg></span><div class="pop-body"><h3>Business Applications &amp; DevOps</h3><p>Connect customer, financial and operational data in one place with intelligent CRM and ERP, then use Microsoft's DevOps tools across the application lifecycle so developers ship faster and the business sees value sooner.</p></div></li>
      <li class="card"><span class="cnum" aria-hidden="true">06</span><span class="badge"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-spark"/></svg></span><div class="pop-body"><h3>Data &amp; AI Enablement</h3><p>Prepare your data and your people for AI. ITHENA pairs Microsoft's platform with our own AI capabilities and hands-on AI workshops to move you from experiments to practical use.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===================== 03 FEATURED OFFER ===================== -->
<section class="pt-sec tint" id="review">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rev">
      <p class="kick">Featured offer</p>
      <h2>Find your hidden Microsoft savings, <em>before your next renewal</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">A quick, painless review to uncover hidden savings and eligible promotions before your next renewal arrives. It's free, and it doesn't require any changes to your environment.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="review">
      <ul class="rv-list rev">
        <li><span class="tick"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-chk"/></svg></span><span><b>Your current products and seat counts</b><span>A clear picture of what you own and use today.</span></span></li>
        <li><span class="tick"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-chk"/></svg></span><span><b>Renewal and commitment dates</b><span>So you can evaluate options well ahead of time.</span></span></li>
        <li><span class="tick"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-chk"/></svg></span><span><b>Monthly vs. annual billing options</b><span>Choose the cash-flow model that works for you.</span></span></li>
        <li><span class="tick"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-chk"/></svg></span><span><b>Defender, Entra ID and Intune opportunities</b><span>Better security and better value from what you already license.</span></span></li>
        <li><span class="tick"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-chk"/></svg></span><span><b>A side-by-side comparison quote</b><span>See the difference through ITHENA in plain numbers.</span></span></li>
        <li><span class="tick"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-chk"/></svg></span><span><b>Recommended next steps</b><span>A practical action plan, not a sales pitch.</span></span></li>
      </ul>
      <aside class="rv-cta rev">
        <h3>Request your free review</h3>
        <!-- 90-120 day window still to be confirmed -->
        <p>Best timed 90 to 120 days before your renewal date, though we can help at any point in the cycle. Approximate seat counts are enough to start.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-p btn-wide" href="https://ithena.ai/contact-us/" data-pt-modal="ptModalReview" aria-haspopup="dialog">Request your free review</a>
        <p class="rv-note">No cost. No obligation. No change to your environment.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===================== 04 APPROACH ===================== -->
<section class="pt-sec" id="approach">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rev">
      <p class="kick">Approach</p>
      <h2>Simple, fast, <em>zero disruption</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">Five stages, from the first conversation about your estate through to a subscription that costs less and is watched all year.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="roles rev">
      <article class="role"><div class="pop-body"><span class="rnum" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Share your details</h3><p>Your current Microsoft products, approximate seat counts and renewal dates</p></div></article>
      <article class="role"><div class="pop-body"><span class="rnum" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>We review</h3><p>We look for savings, eligible promotions and security or value opportunities</p></div></article>
      <article class="role"><div class="pop-body"><span class="rnum" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Compare</h3><p>A side-by-side quote through ITHENA, with no obligation</p></div></article>
      <article class="role"><div class="pop-body"><span class="rnum" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3>Switch smoothly</h3><p>If it makes sense, we move your subscriptions with no interruption to users</p></div></article>
      <article class="role"><div class="pop-body"><span class="rnum" aria-hidden="true">05</span><h3>Stay supported</h3><p>Reviews, tenant support and renewal assistance keep you optimized year-round</p></div></article>
    </div>

    <div class="stats stg">
      <div class="stat">
        <p class="num"><span data-count="70">70</span><i>+</i></p>
        <h4>Digital projects delivered</h4>
        <p>Across manufacturing, life sciences, automotive, energy, government and media.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <p class="num"><span data-count="45">45</span><i>+</i></p>
        <h4>Global customers</h4>
        <p>Operations, manufacturing and service organizations we know how to work with.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <p class="num"><span data-count="200">200</span><i>+</i></p>
        <h4>Engineers and consultants</h4>
        <p>The bench behind every licence, migration, security review and AI workshop.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rev">
      <h3 class="why-h">Ongoing support, not just a transaction</h3>
      <p>Many resellers disappear after the sale. Every ITHENA Microsoft customer gets the full support program, included.</p>
      <div class="svc">
        <dl>
          <div class="srow shead"><dt>Included service</dt><dd>What it means for you</dd></div>
          <div class="srow"><dt><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-user"/></svg>Tenant Support Services</dt><dd>Expert help managing and troubleshooting your Microsoft environment.</dd></div>
          <div class="srow"><dt><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-shield"/></svg>Quarterly Architecture &amp; Security Evaluations</dt><dd>Regular check-ups to keep your setup secure and well-designed.</dd></div>
          <div class="srow"><dt><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-bars"/></svg>Bi-Annual Optimization Reviews</dt><dd>Make sure you're using, and paying for, only what you need.</dd></div>
          <div class="srow"><dt><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-cal"/></svg>Renewal Assistance</dt><dd>No missed dates, no surprise price changes.</dd></div>
          <div class="srow"><dt><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#p-spark"/></svg>Dedicated AI Workshops</dt><dd>Hands-on sessions to help your teams put AI to work.</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===================== 05 FAQ ===================== -->
<section class="pt-sec tint" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rev">
      <p class="kick">Questions</p>
      <h2>What people ask <em>before they switch</em></h2>
      <div class="faq">
        <details>
          <summary>Will switching to ITHENA change how my team uses Microsoft?<span class="cr" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M10 4v12M4 10h12"/></svg></span></summary>
          <p class="ans">No. You keep the same subscriptions, users and applications. What changes is who you buy from, and how much you pay.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Where does the "up to 15%" savings come from?<span class="cr" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M10 4v12M4 10h12"/></svg></span></summary>
          <!-- exact wording pending licensing team approval -->
          <p class="ans">As an authorized Microsoft reseller, ITHENA can offer pricing on your existing subscriptions that's lower than buying direct. Actual savings depend on your products, seat counts and agreement type.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Is the Licensing &amp; Renewal Review really free, and when should I book it?<span class="cr" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M10 4v12M4 10h12"/></svg></span></summary>
          <p class="ans">Yes, there's no cost and no obligation. Ideally book it 90 to 120 days before your renewal date, but we can help at any time. Approximate seat counts and products are enough to get started.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Do you offer support after the sale?<span class="cr" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M10 4v12M4 10h12"/></svg></span></summary>
          <p class="ans">Yes. Tenant support, quarterly architecture and security evaluations, bi-annual optimization reviews, renewal assistance and AI workshops are part of the partnership.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

  </main>
</div>

